use: The Complete Shows', 'contents': 'Live at the Boarding House: The Complete Shows is a four-CD live album by the bluegrass band Old and in the Way. It was recorded on October 1 and October 8, 1973, at the Boarding House in San Francisco, and contains the complete concerts from those dates. It was released by Acoustic Disc and Acoustic Oasis on October 1, 2013. The album includes 55 tracks, 14 of which were previously unreleased.', 'score': 0.8359375, 'is_poisoned': False}]
